        "attribution": "Benabid's contribution to establishing the high-frequency stimulation strategy is particularly clear.",
        "maturity": "Decades of use support durable efficacy for selected motor complications and define its limitations.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "Clinical outcomes depend on target selection, programming, surgery, and patient selection, complicating assignment of all later advances to the original discovery."
